    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d811">

                <pb facs="0760" n="754" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg754"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Uhl to Mr. Runyon.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 78.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-03"><hi rendition="#italic">April 3,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith, for your information
                    and the files of your embassy, copy of a correspondence between this Department
                    and the ambassadors here of Great Britain and Germany respecting the expense of
                    the maintenance of Mataafa and other Samoan chiefs during their temporary
                    detention at Fakaofo.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwin E. Uhl</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
